  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit Agriculture from Morocco to the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this study visit to the Netherlands, a Moroccan delegation of decision-makers in the agriculture sector gets informed about the organization of the sector in the Netherlands and its current development and challenges. The mission includes visits to (government) institutions and companies active in different value chains of the agricultural sectors, research institutions, clusters and incubators. Also, the mission aims to demonstrate and fortify the current support of the Netherlands in the agriculture sector in Morocco.</narrative>
  </description>
